---
title: Blueberry Dessert
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 25 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@crushed graham crackers{11}
@melted butter{0.25%cup}
@cream cheese{8%oz package}
@blueberry pie filling{1%can}
@sugar{1%cup}
@beaten eggs{2}
@whipped cream
@vanilla

Mix crumbs, 1/2 c sugar and butter. Pat into a 9x9 in pan. Beat eggs, remaining sugar, vanilla and cream cheese together until smooth. Pour over crust and bake for 25 minutes at 375 degrees. Cool. Pour pie filling over the top and garnish with whipped cream.
